# Server-side settings for the /api/quote-lead function (website quote form -> Rotor lead).
# Do NOT put real values in this file or anywhere in the repo.
#
# Setup: Vercel dashboard > cleanz-atx > Settings > Environment Variables > Add
#   Key:   ROTOR_API_KEY
#   Value: your Rotor Open API key
#   Environments: Production (also Preview if you want previews to send leads)
# Then redeploy (Deployments > ... > Redeploy) so the function picks it up.
ROTOR_API_KEY=
